# OTML Practical 2: Model Fitting and Error Measurement

. Objective
To understand model fitting and error measurement using a Music Recommendation System.

. Concepts Covered
- Data Loading
- Feature Selection
- Train-Test Split
- Decision Tree Classifier
- Model Fitting
- Prediction
- Accuracy Measurement

. OTML Concepts Mapped
- Model Fitting
- Error Measurement
- Optimization
- Prediction
- Learning

. Technologies Used
- Python
- Jupyter Notebook
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib

. Dataset
music1.csv

. Files Included
- OTML_Practical_2.ipynb
- music1.csv
- requirements.txt

. How to Run

| Step 1
Install requirements

pip install -r requirements.txt

| Step 2
Open Jupyter Notebook

jupyter notebook

| Step 3
Open:
OTML_Practical_2.ipynb

| Step 4
Run all cells sequentially

. Learning Outcome
Students will understand how machine learning models are trained and evaluated using accuracy metrics.


